{
  "id": "sheet.engine",
  "version": 3,
  "title": "SCORE",
  "description": "Engine character-sheet field catalog. Games register hook providers for hook:* sources; engine:* rows are generic. Custom layouts merge rows by slot via resolve_profile_slot / append_layout_band. New meters: add a hook:* (or engine:*) row here, or call register_auto_field so the overflow band picks it up.",
